          "thm-l2-counting-process-integral-isometry"
        ],
        "dependency_level": 6,
        "statement": "The normalized Cox score equals an IID subject martingale sum with deterministic population risk mean plus an oP(1) replacement remainder; the influence vectors are centered with covariance I."
      },
