        "dependency_level": 7,
        "statement": "A measurable consistent score root has the local asymptotic linear expansion I^{-1} n^{-1/2} sum_i integral (Z_i-bar z) dM_i plus oP(1)."
      },
      {
        "id": "cor-cox-partial-likelihood-asymptotic-normality",
